<!-- 5. WHY PAANYA EMPIRE EXISTS (Unified vs Fragmented Model) -->
<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-primary uppercase mb-2 sm:mb-3 block">WHY PAANYA EMPIRE EXISTS</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        CONSTRUCTION SHOULD FEEL SIMPLER FOR THE CLIENT.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Building a bespoke residence or commercial headquarters involves hundreds of critical decisions, disjointed vendors, and technical complexities. Our purpose is to bring all of them under one roof.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Comparative Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Fragmented (Traditional) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-error"></span>
            <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-error">The Fragmented Approach</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-3 sm:mb-4">Conventional Disconnected Delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            When projects are parcelled out to independent architects, contractors, and decorators, the client becomes an unpaid general manager trapped between competing incentives.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-error flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span>
              <span>4 to 7 conflicting contracts with divided accountability</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-error flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span>
              <span>Constant finger-pointing between architects and site builders</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-error flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span>
              <span>Unpredictable budget escalation and surprise variations</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-error flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span>
              <span>Disorganized schedules with multi-month delivery delays</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 pt-4 sm:pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/30 text-xs text-outline italic">
          "The client shoulders the burden of misalignment and delays."
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Paanya Unified Solution -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-xl bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-primary/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-inverse-primary"></span>
            <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-inverse-primary">The Paanya Way</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-on-primary mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-snug">
            ONE TEAM. ONE RESPONSIBILITY. ONE COMPLETE PROJECT.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-outline-variant mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            We assume end-to-end contractual and moral accountability. Your dedicated Paanya Director coordinates every structural calculation, permit review, material delivery, and finishing reveal.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
            <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/5 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-inverse-primary">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
                <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Single Lead</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-outline-variant leading-relaxed">One direct desk for all design choices, budgets, schedules, and structural sign-offs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/5 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-inverse-primary">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
                <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Guaranteed Budgets</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-outline-variant leading-relaxed">Definitive line-item specifications with fixed contract milestone gate releases.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/5 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-inverse-primary">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
                <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Synchronized Teams</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-outline-variant leading-relaxed">Structural engineers collaborate directly with interior designers from day one.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest/5 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-inverse-primary">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
                <span class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Visual Reporting</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-outline-variant leading-relaxed">Weekly high-res photo briefs, site inspection logs, and zero surprises.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 sm:mt-10 pt-4 sm:pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-outline-variant">Total peace of mind from ground break to key handover.</span>
          <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-inverse-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors" href="/process">
            <span>EXPLORE OUR METHODOLOGY</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
